title: "bigthree-dynet-pd: Dynamic-network Prisoner's Dilemma simulation with personality-driven tie dynamics"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025-11-24"

abstract: "Agent-based simulation code for a dynamic-network Prisoner's Dilemma model in which Extraversion, Openness, and Agreeableness shape partner capacity, partner search, cooperation, tie formation, and tie cutting."

